Server init.

>> x := Blob baru: 65 tipe: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Program pengaturan: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server tautkan: (
 Daftar baru ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Daftar baru ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x dari: 0 panjang: 1), baris-baru.
x bebaskan.

